{%- if use_dbt %}
Run dbt commands for this project.

Ask the user what they want to do:
1. **build** — Run `uv run --group dbt dbt build --project-dir dbt/` (compile + run + test)
2. **test** — Run `uv run --group dbt dbt test --project-dir dbt/`
3. **run** — Run `uv run --group dbt dbt run --project-dir dbt/`
4. **compile** — Run `uv run --group dbt dbt compile --project-dir dbt/`

If they specify a model selector (e.g. "just the gold models"), add `--select <selector>`.
Report the results and highlight any test failures.
{%- else %}
dbt is not configured for this project.
To enable it, re-run `copier update` and set `use_dbt=true`.
{%- endif %}
